    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every journey begins with the first ... Sword?! Or maybe two? The journey of a lifetime begins in a world full of magic, monsters and adventure in the nostalgic style of classic Japanese role-playing games. Defy evil in exciting battles, solve tricky puzzles, meet new friends and uncover the secrets of the world that lie hidden in the shadows of the past. It's A Life's Journey!</i><br><br>Discover the continent of Tasenas, a fantasy world with a mysterious past. As 15-year-old Hiro, you set out to find your grandfather's murderer and become entangled in a complex conspiracy. Meet new companions, hone your combat skills, and try to put a stop to the secret mastermind.  <br> <br>In turn-based battles, the AGI skill value determines how quickly characters and enemies take turns. When it's a character's turn, everyone involved in the fight waits politely for your inputs\u2014a strategy rather than a rush.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675890/extras/620938eaead308e36e4e979ceac27ef4.avif?t=1752926318\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Over the course of approximately 40-50 hours of gameplay, you'll unlock new TP modes, mostly story-driven. These allow you to decide how your characters earn technique points (TP) to use techniques in battle. Adapt the TP modes to your play style and your group.<br><br><strong><i>In-game translation into English is available via \u201cOptions.\u201d Skills and quest-journal texts are currently only available in German.</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every journey begins with the first ... Sword?! Or maybe two? The journey of a lifetime begins in a world full of magic, monsters and adventure in the nostalgic style of classic Japanese role-playing games. Defy evil in exciting battles, solve tricky puzzles, meet new friends and uncover the secrets of the world that lie hidden in the shadows of the past. It's A Life's Journey!</i><br><br>Discover the continent of Tasenas, a fantasy world with a mysterious past. As 15-year-old Hiro, you set out to find your grandfather's murderer and become entangled in a complex conspiracy. Meet new companions, hone your combat skills, and try to put a stop to the secret mastermind.  <br> <br>In turn-based battles, the AGI skill value determines how quickly characters and enemies take turns. When it's a character's turn, everyone involved in the fight waits politely for your inputs\u2014a strategy rather than a rush.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675890/extras/620938eaead308e36e4e979ceac27ef4.avif?t=1752926318\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Over the course of approximately 40-50 hours of gameplay, you'll unlock new TP modes, mostly story-driven. These allow you to decide how your characters earn technique points (TP) to use techniques in battle. Adapt the TP modes to your play style and your group.<br><br><strong><i>In-game translation into English is available via \u201cOptions.\u201d Skills and quest-journal texts are currently only available in German.</i></strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Story-driven role-playing game in retro JRPG style with an active-time-battle-wait system with a rock soundtrack. The higher a character's AGI value, the faster their turn. Earn &quot;SP&quot; in battle and learn new skills. Increase their level by using them, improving their loading time and attributes.",
